"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[75024],{75024:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/a-murder-is-announced.png\\"\\n          title=\\"A Murder is Announced\\"\\n          author=\\"Agatha Christie\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Golden Bough\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2013-05-27\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788982737077\\"\\n          rating=4\\n          tags=\\"mystery\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nThe setting of <mark>announcing</mark> a murder through a newspaper advertisement is original.  \\n> “A murder is announced. Friday, October 29th, at 6:30 PM. Place: Little Paddocks. Those who are interested are welcome.”\\n\\nThe residents think this advertisement is either a play or a joke, and some come to the Little Paddocks mansion out of curiosity.  \\nThe owner of the mansion is flustered but welcomes the guests, and when the set time arrives, a sudden power outage occurs.  \\n<br>\\nAt that moment, a gunshot rings out, and an intruder enters but is shot dead on the spot.  \\n<br>\\nThe play seemed to end as an attempted murder by the intruder, but a new truth is revealed by ```Miss Marple```.  \\n<br>\\nThe family tree was complicated, so it was a bit difficult, but I read it with interest because the setting was unique.  \\n"}')}}]);